@startuml
title UML sequence - consented audience, partner advice and withdrawal (WP-38)
actor "Data steward" as staff
participant "Staff API" as api
database "analytics (Data role)" as an
participant "SIM_JOURNEY\n(local partner role)" as partner
actor Customer as cust

staff -> api : build savings_starter v1
api -> an : signals at fact cut;\nexclude no consent / restricted
an --> api : members (pseudonymous tokens),\nbank-rule insights
staff -> api : export to SIM_JOURNEY
api -> an : purpose permitted for partner?\nconsent re-checked per member
partner -> an : signed GET export
an --> partner : tokens only\n(withdrawn since export withheld)
partner -> an : signed recommendation
alt allowlisted advice, member permits marketing
  an --> partner : ACCEPTED (advisory insight)
else extra fields / unlisted code or route / markup
  an --> partner : REJECTED + reason (recorded)
else member withdrew
  an --> partner : SUPPRESSED (recorded)
end
cust -> an : GET insights
an --> cust : notices + suggestions with "why"
cust -> an : withdraw marketing (WP-26 preference)
note over an : suggestions hidden, never deleted;\nno Core, entitlement or application path
staff -> api : outcome report
api -> an : denominators, outcomes,\nwatermarks, LATE_DATA flag
@enduml
